WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.957 --> 00:00:06.527
OF COURSE THERE IS ONE OBVIOUS

00:00:06.528 --> 00:00:07.762
SOLUTION, FIRE MARY BARRA.

00:00:07.763 --> 00:00:08.896
FOR YEARS LIBERAL CITIES AND

00:00:08.897 --> 00:00:09.597
STATES HAVE BEEN CLAIMING THE

00:00:09.598 --> 00:00:12.366
RIGHT TO IGNORE FEDERAL

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:13.567
IMMIGRATION LAW.

00:00:13.568 --> 00:00:14.969
NOW ONE SMALL TOWN POLICE CHIEF

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:16.370
IN WASHINGTON STATE IS SAYING

00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:17.672
THE SAME PRINCIPLE CAN BE

00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:21.242
APPLIED TO FAR-REACHING GUN LAW

00:00:21.243 --> 00:00:21.976
LAWS.

00:00:21.977 --> 00:00:24.011
A NEW GUN-CONTROL ORDINANCE IN

00:00:24.012 --> 00:00:25.179
WASHINGTON IMPOSES STRICTER

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:25.880
BACKGROUND CHECKS, RAISES THE

00:00:25.881 --> 00:00:27.748
AGE FOR BUYING A SEMIAUTOMATIC

00:00:27.749 --> 00:00:29.317
RIFLE AND ALLOWS GUN OWNERS TO

00:00:29.318 --> 00:00:31.152
BE CRIMINALLY PROSECUTED IF THE

00:00:31.153 --> 00:00:33.788
FIREARMS ARE STOLEN OR USED

00:00:33.789 --> 00:00:36.924
ILLEGALLY.

00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:37.725
HE SAYS HE WANTS HIS TOWN TO BE

00:00:37.726 --> 00:00:39.894
A SANCTUARY FROM THESE NEW GUN

00:00:39.895 --> 00:00:40.194
LAWS.

00:00:40.195 --> 00:00:43.564
SOME OF THE LOCAL RESIDENTS

00:00:43.565 --> 00:00:45.099
IMPOSE, OPPOSE THE NEW MEASURE.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:46.534
&gt;&gt; OPPONENTS SAY IT ALLOWS GUN

00:00:46.535 --> 00:00:51.105
OWNERS TO SECURE THEM IN A WAY

00:00:51.106 --> 00:00:51.706
THAT COULD BE DANGEROUS.

00:00:51.707 --> 00:00:53.774
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE NOT GOING TO TELL THE

00:00:53.775 --> 00:00:54.942
CRIMINAL, COULD YOU HOLD ON FOR

00:00:54.943 --> 00:01:00.114
A MOMENT BECAUSE I HAVE A LOT  I

00:01:00.115 --> 00:01:00.915
A MOMENT BECAUSE I HAVE A LOT  T

00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:04.785
LOCKED AND I HAVE TO SAFELY

00:01:04.786 --> 00:01:05.319
STORE IT SOMEWHERE.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:06.954
&gt;&gt; YOU CALL POLICE AND THINGS GO

00:01:06.955 --> 00:01:08.789
DOWN, THAT'S LESS THAN ONE

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.326
MINUTE AND THE SECONDS COUNT.

00:01:12.327 --> 00:01:13.961
&gt;&gt; Tucker: CHIEF, THANKS VERY

00:01:13.962 --> 00:01:15.129
MUCH FOR COMING ON.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:18.699
IT'S GOOD TO SEE YOU.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.302
&gt;&gt; GOOD EVENING, TUCKER, THANKS

00:01:21.303 --> 00:01:22.136
FOR HAVING ME.

00:01:22.137 --> 00:01:24.739
&gt;&gt; SO IS THIS IN FACT THE

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:26.907
SANCTUARY FOR THE GUN LAWS OF

00:01:26.908 --> 00:01:28.109
YOUR STATE?

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.910
&gt;&gt; I HAVE SUGGESTED AN ORDINANCE

00:01:29.911 --> 00:01:31.312
AND RECOMMENDED IT TO THE

00:01:31.313 --> 00:01:33.214
CITY COUNCIL AND IF THEY ARE IN

00:01:33.215 --> 00:01:34.749
THE PROCESS OF REVIEWING THAT

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:36.550
AND DOING THEIR DUE DILIGENCE TO

00:01:36.551 --> 00:01:39.754
SEE IF THEY WANT TO PASS THAT.

00:01:39.755 --> 00:01:41.822
AS FAR AS THE POLICE DEPARTMENT

00:01:41.823 --> 00:01:44.291
GOES, WE WILL NOT BE ENFORCING

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:44.592
THAT.

00:01:44.593 --> 00:01:46.761
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SUBSIDIES THAT HAVE

00:01:46.762 --> 00:01:48.696
DECIDED TO IGNORE FEDERAL

00:01:48.697 --> 00:01:49.430
IMMIGRATION LAW HAVE RECEIVED

00:01:49.431 --> 00:01:50.698
THE APPLAUSE AND SUPPORT OF

00:01:50.699 --> 00:01:51.932
ALMOST EVERYONE ON THE AMERICAN

00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:52.233
LEFT.

00:01:52.234 --> 00:01:53.300
WHAT DO YOU THINK THE RESPONSE

00:01:53.301 --> 00:01:57.238
WILL BE IF YOU ARE TOWN PASSES

00:01:57.239 --> 00:01:57.938
THIS ORDINANCE?

00:01:57.939 --> 00:02:00.741
&gt;&gt; I DON'T THINK THE SAME PEOPLE

00:02:00.742 --> 00:02:01.675
WOULD BE VERY HAPPY.

00:02:01.676 --> 00:02:05.146
THE THING ABOUT IT IS, ILLEGAL

00:02:05.147 --> 00:02:05.946
IMMIGRANTS ARE COVERED BY THE

00:02:05.947 --> 00:02:08.349
BILL OF RIGHTS AND THE

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.819
CONSTITUTION AND GUN OWNERS ARE.

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:13.921
&gt;&gt; Tucker: A VERY GOOD POINT.

00:02:13.922 --> 00:02:14.722
SO WHAT WILL HAPPEN NEXT?

00:02:14.723 --> 00:02:16.357
WILL THE GOVERNOR OF THE STATE

00:02:16.358 --> 00:02:18.459
TRY TO FORCE YOU TO ENFORCE THE

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.861
LAW THAT YOU THINK IS

00:02:20.862 --> 00:02:21.529
UNCONSTITUTIONAL?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:24.365
&gt;&gt; WELL I DON'T KNOW HOW IT

00:02:24.366 --> 00:02:25.900
COULD, TUCKER.

00:02:25.901 --> 00:02:27.435
WE LIVE IN A CONSTITUTIONAL

00:02:27.436 --> 00:02:28.636
REPUBLIC, CONTRARY TO WHAT A LOT

00:02:28.637 --> 00:02:31.272
OF PEOPLE TELL US, THAT WE LIVE

00:02:31.273 --> 00:02:32.139
IN A DEMOCRACY.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:34.008
BUT WE HAVE THE RULE OF LAW IN

00:02:34.009 --> 00:02:35.176
THIS STATE AND THE

00:02:35.177 --> 00:02:36.010
UNITED STATES, AND THE

00:02:36.011 --> 00:02:38.345
CONSTITUTION IS THE LAW OF THE

00:02:38.346 --> 00:02:39.346
LAND.

00:02:39.347 --> 00:02:40.347
EVERYBODY KNOWS WHAT THE

00:02:40.348 --> 00:02:41.148
SECOND AMENDMENT SAYS, A LOT OF

00:02:41.149 --> 00:02:42.983
YOUR VIEWERS MAY NOT KNOW WHAT

00:02:42.984 --> 00:02:43.818
THE WASHINGTON STATE

00:02:43.819 --> 00:02:46.487
CONSTITUTION SAYS ABOUT FIREARMS

00:02:46.488 --> 00:02:49.290
BUT QUICKLY IT SAYS THE RIGHT OF

00:02:49.291 --> 00:02:50.724
THE INDIVIDUAL CITIZEN TO BEAR

00:02:50.725 --> 00:02:52.159
ARMS AGAINST HIMSELF OR THE

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.595
STATE SHALL NOT BE IMPAIRED.

00:02:54.596 --> 00:02:56.797
SO I DON'T KNOW HOW THEY CAN GET

00:02:56.798 --> 00:02:57.665
AROUND THAT AND TRY TO FORCE ME

00:02:57.666 --> 00:03:01.102
TO GO AGAINST MY OATH OF OFFICE

00:03:01.103 --> 00:03:03.938
TO UPHOLD THAT.

00:03:03.939 --> 00:03:05.106
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT THAT'S

00:03:05.107 --> 00:03:05.506
INTERESTING.

00:03:05.507 --> 00:03:06.640
IT SOUNDS LIKE IT'S ALREADY

00:03:06.641 --> 00:03:10.144
BEING IGNORED.

00:03:10.145 --> 00:03:13.147
SO REALLY QUICKLY, THE STATE LAW

00:03:13.148 --> 00:03:13.948
WOULD REQUIRE GUN OWNERS TO KEEP

00:03:13.949 --> 00:03:18.385
THEIR GUNS LOCKED UP AT ALL

00:03:18.386 --> 00:03:19.720
TIMES.

00:03:19.721 --> 00:03:21.155
&gt;&gt; IT REQUIRES YOU TO KEEP IT

00:03:21.156 --> 00:03:23.958
LOCKED UP BECAUSE IF SOMEONE

00:03:23.959 --> 00:03:26.327
GAINS ACCESS TO YOUR GUN, SAY

00:03:26.328 --> 00:03:29.096
YOU ARE AWAY FROM HOME AND

00:03:29.097 --> 00:03:30.264
SOMEONE BREAKS IN AND STEALS

00:03:30.265 --> 00:03:31.332
YOUR GUN, AND THEN COMMITS A

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:32.766
CRIME WITH IT, YOU COULD BE

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:34.335
CHARGED WITH A FELONY FOR THAT

00:03:34.336 --> 00:03:37.304
PERSON GETTING HER GUN AND

00:03:37.305 --> 00:03:39.440
COMMITTING A CRIME.

00:03:39.441 --> 00:03:41.542
&gt;&gt; CHARGING SOMEONE WHO HAS YOUR

00:03:41.543 --> 00:03:47.281
CAR STOLEN, IT'S RIDICULOUS.

00:03:47.282 --> 00:03:48.415
&gt;&gt; THAT IS RIDICULOUS.

00:03:48.416 --> 00:03:49.416
AND GOOD FOR YOU FOR FIGHTING

00:03:49.417 --> 00:03:55.257
BACK AGAINST IT.

